reestyle and four in Greco-Roman by the time of the 1936 Olympics. In Berlin, he made history by winning the heavyweight class in both " [:a {:href "/results/122315"} "freestyle"] " and Greco-Roman, the only time this has ever happened (as of 2024), making him the absolute champion wrestler of the year. In 1937, he won the European title in Greco-Roman before retiring in 1938 due to a shoulder injury. In 1991, Palusalu was voted the greatest Estonian athlete of all-time."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "30"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/57825"} "Kristjan Palusalu"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/EST"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/EST.png"}] "EST"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "119"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60102"} "John Nyman"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "173"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58371"} "Kurt Hornfischer"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "148"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60307"} "Mehmet Çoban"]] [:td {} [